<title>SPAIN: TABLE-Fecsa H1 gp net profit 6.81 bln pta.</title>
<headline>TABLE-Fecsa H1 gp net profit 6.81 bln pta.</headline>
<dateline>MADRID 1997-07-31</dateline>
<text>
<p>Results for six months to end-June for Fuerzas Electricas de Catalunya (Fecsa) group given by Endesa parent to analysts.</p>
<p> Net taxed			    6.81	  vs    8.52</p>
<p> Operating revenues	     116.44	  vs    n.a.</p>
<p> Net turnover		     116.29	  vs    n.a.</p>
<p> Sales to clients		 106.43	  vs    n.a.</p>
<p> Operating costs		   92.90	  vs    n.a.</p>
<p> Operating profit		  23.54	  vs    n.a.</p>
<p> Financial revenues		 2.81	  vs    n.a.</p>
<p> Financial expenses		18.59	  vs    n.a.</p>
<p> Financial losses		  15.78	  vs    n.a.</p>
<p> Ordinary profit		    7.74	  vs    n.a.</p>
<p> Extraordinary loss		 0.41	  vs    n.a.</p>
<p> Pretax profit			7.33	  vs    n.a.</p>
<p>NOTE: No further information was immediately available.</p>
</text>
